{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3751260","name":"The Blood of Dawnwalker 黎明行者之血","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/ab7ce1f066d3d2a557096d215bc0afa6.webp?t=1789144593\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/ab7ce1f066d3d2a557096d215bc0afa6.poster.avif?t=1789144593\" class=\"bb_img\" width=646 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14世纪的欧洲。连年的战火使得这片大地满目疮痍，无情的黑死病则让幸存者们惶惶不可终日。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在人类最黑暗的时刻……他们降临了。对于吸血鬼来说，这是一个千载难逢的机会，经历了数千年的逃亡与躲藏之后，他们终于从阴影之中走了出来，自由与权力唾手可及。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >其他诞生自黑夜中的怪物也纷纷选择效忠吸血鬼的统治。当古老的传说成为现实，我们熟悉的历史将不复存在。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在游戏中，你将扮演科恩，在阴差阳错之下，这位年轻人被转化为一名Dawnwalker，他命中注定将在白昼与黑夜这两个世界的分界线上永恒徘徊。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >竭尽全力守护自己的人性，或者选择拥抱诅咒之力以拯救你的家人。无论如何选择，你都无法逃避最关键的问题：是选择你的灵魂，还是你所爱之人的生命？</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/fcf644264650c19c0bef6ba109ef199f.avif?t=1789144593\" width=646 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >按照自己的意愿去体验并塑造剧情。肩负起拯救家人的任务，或者向将自己变成半人半鬼模样的罪魁祸首复仇，摧毁一切胆敢阻挡你的敌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索潜藏在山谷之中的古老秘密。直面挑战，或者花费时间精心准备。独自前行，或者寻觅患难与共的朋友与不同寻常的盟友。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/0ffc1df980f341f2abdd440dee8f61f9.poster.avif?t=1789144593\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/0ffc1df980f341f2abdd440dee8f61f9.webm?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/0ffc1df980f341f2abdd440dee8f61f9.mp4?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/27b6eeb8853110ec8cfc79082291a4e2.avif?t=1789144593\" width=646 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/050df3b8da3397a56e87c323f1ac78a4.avif?t=1789144593\" width=646 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >体验两种截然不同的游戏机制，选择独一无二的能力并发现不可思议的秘密，实现目标的道路不止有一条。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >尝试不同手段并见证这个世界对你的回应。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/4d290a70c5763490ff1900a2487ebc93.poster.avif?t=1789144593\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/4d290a70c5763490ff1900a2487ebc93.webm?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/4d290a70c5763490ff1900a2487ebc93.mp4?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/1cf497a9f63fad7db161effc8b8324ed.avif?t=1789144593\" width=646 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当你选择行动或不作为，都会影响周围一切。你的家人时间有限，在每一次接下任务后，时间就会流逝，离结局更近一步。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因此你无法顾及所有人，必须斟酌伸出援手或是弃于不顾。时间不等人，而你的敌人们同样不会坐以待毙。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/b18c7c71de0d2a0bd01075e81609d193.poster.avif?t=1789144593\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/b18c7c71de0d2a0bd01075e81609d193.webm?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/b18c7c71de0d2a0bd01075e81609d193.mp4?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/84081a57efbb9f3b5aa21cd715d89b9b.avif?t=1789144593\" width=646 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >挣脱重力的束缚，化身摧枯拉朽的狂暴之力，最大限度利用自己作为吸血鬼的超自然能力。或者举起手中长剑并运用强大的魔力，以人类之身挑战怪物。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >白天与黑夜将为你带来不同的形态，体验并适应不同状态下的优势与弱势。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/ea61cb221e1e5a75208fb066d978f944.poster.avif?t=1789144593\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/ea61cb221e1e5a75208fb066d978f944.webm?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/ea61cb221e1e5a75208fb066d978f944.mp4?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/faa53f0e86802b8a6c45fbc019da8d3b.avif?t=1789144593\" width=646 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >深入手工打造的开放世界并见证一切。游历四方，漫步于繁茂森林、广阔平原、险恶沼泽、陡峭高山与中世纪村落。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索被遗忘的废墟、寻找远古文明的遗迹并揭开被隐瞒的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/774793038a237d8eae82893ba5cc2b9e.poster.avif?t=1789144593\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/774793038a237d8eae82893ba5cc2b9e.webm?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/774793038a237d8eae82893ba5cc2b9e.mp4?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/81476ff6f8dc095ac71e395c92ab967e.avif?t=1789144593\" width=646 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >诞生于对角色扮演类游戏的热爱，见证一个崭新传奇系列的开端。由次世代虚幻引擎5驱动的瑰丽世界必将让你流连忘返。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/a966502e07f3b9ac2cfcda1aa89df753.poster.avif?t=1789144593\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/a966502e07f3b9ac2cfcda1aa89df753.webm?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/a966502e07f3b9ac2cfcda1aa89df753.mp4?t=1789144593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/extras/dec70f853e15aa9e0d03545e2e8e6596.avif?t=1789144593\" width=780 height=145 /></span></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/7b0c1860c7c2fca069ae53c049b737176dbfb8d4/header_schinese.jpg?t=1789144593","website":"https://dawnwalkergame.com","developers":["Rebel Wolves"],"publishers":["Bandai Namco Entertainment"],"release_date":"2026 年 9 月 2 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"69.99","final":"69.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语<strong>*</strong>, 意大利语<strong>*</strong>, 德语<strong>*</strong>, 西班牙语 - 西班牙<strong>*</strong>, 捷克语, 匈牙利语, 日语, 韩语, 波兰语<strong>*</strong>, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 简体中文, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 繁体中文, 土耳其语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","Steam 集换式卡牌","自定义音量控制","可调整难度","推荐使用手柄","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","随时保存","Steam 输入 API 支持","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","冒险","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10, DirectX12<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400F / AMD Ryzen 7 2700X<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 60 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> VRAM: 6GB // Storage on SSD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10, DirectX12<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i7-11700K / AMD Ryzen 7 5700X<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 4060 / Radeon RX 7600 XT / Intel Arc B580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 60 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> VRAM: 8GB // Storage on SSD</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/1af5d14d9b6a36c14eae3bebf56c0e0f63235633/ss_1af5d14d9b6a36c14eae3bebf56c0e0f63235633.600x338.jpg?t=1789144593","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/1af5d14d9b6a36c14eae3bebf56c0e0f63235633/ss_1af5d14d9b6a36c14eae3bebf56c0e0f63235633.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789144593"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/8b1df8a547116394a9c1b7225c11904c09dc9a37/ss_8b1df8a547116394a9c1b7225c11904c09dc9a37.600x338.jpg?t=1789144593","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/8b1df8a547116394a9c1b7225c11904c09dc9a37/ss_8b1df8a547116394a9c1b7225c11904c09dc9a37.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789144593"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/b91c26c945ec2453f7dbb1f6a3f8992edcccc484/ss_b91c26c945ec2453f7dbb1f6a3f8992edcccc484.600x338.jpg?t=1789144593","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751260/b91c26c945ec2453f7dbb1f6a3f8992edcccc484/ss_b91c26c945ec2453f7dbb1f6a3f8992edcccc484.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789144593"}]}